window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v26-002-6b85439a5117845c.json"]={sha256:"6b85439a5117845c762fab66befa4f106926f95c2b74522bb3cdeaacc65169cd",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-f715bedbee601485","url":"https://archive.computerhistory.org/resources/access/text/2010/02/102653900-05-01-acc.pdf","title":"Connection Machine CM-5 technical material","titleEn":"Connection Machine CM-5 technical material","publisher":"Thinking Machines / Computer History Museum archive","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-002","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-002","related":[{"id":"hpc-v26-003","referenceUrls":["https://newsreleases.sandia.gov/releases/2006/asci-red-decom.html"],"title":"ASCI Red：大規模純 CPU 的局部工作預算","titleEn":"ASCI Red: local work budgets for massively parallel CPUs","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付索引分配表、尾端測試與平均對最大值比較；覆蓋103個索引恰一次，26/14毫秒是這些等成本假設下不含通訊的理想時間；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver partition indices, tail tests and mean-versus-maximum accounting. Cover all 103 indices exactly once; 26/14 ms remain ideal times under the equal-cost, zero-communication assumptions. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"把初始化、局部計算、結果提交三段分欄；本模型把前後固定段合成8毫秒；38與23正確，並列1216與1472工作者毫秒，不宣稱真機實測。","differenceEn":"Separate initialization, local compute and result submission; the model aggregates fixed segments into 8 ms. Verify 38 and 23 with resource costs 1216 and 1472 worker-ms, explicitly excluding claims of machine measurement.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["N筆獨立等成本工作交給P個工作者，最長清單是 ceil(N/P)，完成時間由最大清單而非平均決定；合成 N=103筆、P=8，每筆2毫秒；改P=16，不計傳輸與啟動；名義式 13*2 = 26 ms；變更式 7*2 = 14 ms。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","合成每輪時間 T(P)=W/P+s，其中W是可分工作、s是串行準備；不代表實機拓樸；W=960毫秒、s=8毫秒，比較P=32與64，同一問題大小；名義式 960/32+8 = 38 ms/iteration；變更式 960/64+8 = 23 ms/iteration。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For N independent equal-cost jobs on P workers, the longest list is ceil(N/P); completion follows the maximum rather than the mean. Synthetic N=103, P=8, 2 ms per item; compare P=16 with transfer and startup excluded. Nominal 13*2 = 26 ms; changed 7*2 = 14 ms. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Teaching iteration time T(P)=W/P+s, where W is divisible work and s serial setup; it is not a machine-topology model. W=960 ms, s=8 ms, comparing 32 and 64 workers at fixed problem size. Nominal 960/32+8 = 38 ms/iteration; changed 960/64+8 = 23 ms/iteration. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v26-012","referenceUrls":["https://docs.olcf.ornl.gov/systems/frontier_user_guide.html"],"title":"Frontier MI250X：GPU 封裝與 GCD 身份","titleEn":"Frontier MI250X: packages versus compute dies","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付索引分配表、尾端測試與平均對最大值比較；覆蓋103個索引恰一次，26/14毫秒是這些等成本假設下不含通訊的理想時間；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver partition indices, tail tests and mean-versus-maximum accounting. Cover all 103 indices exactly once; 26/14 ms remain ideal times under the equal-cost, zero-communication assumptions. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"建立節點→封裝→GCD三層身份表，為每個工作記可見裝置ID及封裝關聯；32/64重現，八個GCD各有唯一分片，未把總HBM當單一共享空間。","differenceEn":"Build node→package→GCD identities and record visible device plus package for each job. Reproduce 32/64 with unique shards on eight GCDs and no assumption of one pooled HBM space.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["N筆獨立等成本工作交給P個工作者，最長清單是 ceil(N/P)，完成時間由最大清單而非平均決定；合成 N=103筆、P=8，每筆2毫秒；改P=16，不計傳輸與啟動；名義式 13*2 = 26 ms；變更式 7*2 = 14 ms。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","可見GCD數D=packages×dies；等分N工作後每GCD N/D，不將封裝數當裝置數；合成N=256工作、4封裝×2GCD；另案N=512，所有GCD可用；名義式 256/(4*2) = 32 jobs/GCD；變更式 512/(4*2) = 64 jobs/GCD。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For N independent equal-cost jobs on P workers, the longest list is ceil(N/P); completion follows the maximum rather than the mean. Synthetic N=103, P=8, 2 ms per item; compare P=16 with transfer and startup excluded. Nominal 13*2 = 26 ms; changed 7*2 = 14 ms. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Visible GCD count D=packages×dies; equal shards have N/D work, not N/packages. Synthetic N 256, 4 packages×2 GCD; compare N 512 with every GCD available. Nominal 256/(4*2) = 32 jobs/GCD; changed 512/(4*2) = 64 jobs/GCD. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-eefea3b644112566","url":"https://newsreleases.sandia.gov/releases/2006/asci-red-decom.html","title":"Sandia’s ASCI Red is decommissioned","titleEn":"Sandia’s ASCI Red is decommissioned","publisher":"Sandia National Laboratories","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-72e04e73d7a2f0e8","url":"https://docs.olcf.ornl.gov/systems/frontier_user_guide.html","title":"Frontier User Guide","titleEn":"Frontier User Guide","publisher":"Oak Ridge Leadership Computing Facility","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
